BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Splat Space (Durham Hackerspace)
UID:event_316985923@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261031T052550Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261103T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261103T210000
SUMMARY:Splat Space Member meeting
DESCRIPTION:Splat Space - Durham's Hackerspace\nOn the first Tuesday of ev
 ery month\, we hold our Member Meeting. This meeting is an opportunity for
  the Splat Space board to update the members on events\, issues and news r
 elated to Splat Space.\n\nWhile the majority of our members attend in pers
 on and we encourage them to do so\, we stream the meeting using Google Mee
 t for those who want to attend remotely.\n\nClick this link attend the mee
 ting online.\n\n[https://meet.google.com/usc-eavv-jkc](https://meet.google
 .com/usc-eavv-jkc)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/splatspace/events/316985923/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261014T232825Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261014T232825Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Splat Space (Durham Hackerspace)
UID:event_317001100@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261031T052550Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261104T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261104T200000
SUMMARY:Woodshop Wednesdays
DESCRIPTION:Splat Space - Durham's Hackerspace\nHave a project you need he
 lp with? Want to learn how to safely use the wood shop equipment? Just wan
 t to hang out and talk shop? Come on by. Each week one or more of our more
  knowledgeable wood workers will be there to help. No need to sign up.\n\n
 We look forward to seeing you all there!\n\nThis is a members only event.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/splatspace/events/317001100/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261015T215537Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261015T215537Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Splat Space (Durham Hackerspace)
UID:event_316617503@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261031T052550Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T150000
SUMMARY:Monthly Cleanup
DESCRIPTION:Splat Space - Durham's Hackerspace\nThe Saturday after the mon
 thly members meeting of each month is our Cleanup Day. It's a chance for o
 ur members to come together to help make Splat Space more organized. Wheth
 er it's sorting bolts\, vacuuming the carpets\, removing scrap or re-arran
 ging the space\, anything that helps to make the space more open and organ
 ized is appreciated.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/splatspace/events/316617503/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260918T225808Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260918T225808Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
