SUMMARY:Splat Space Monthly Cleanup
DESCRIPTION:Splat Space - Durham's Hackerspace\nThe last Sunday of each mo
 nth is our Cleanup Day. It's a chance for our members to come together to 
 help make Splat Space more organized. Whether it's sorting bolts\, vacuumi
 ng the carpets\, removing scrap or re-arranging the space\, anything that 
